# Enterprise Multi-Document Q&A System (RAG)

A FastAPI-based RAG backend that allows users to upload multiple documents and ask questions based on their content.

## Features

* Supports PDF, DOCX, and TXT documents
* Retrieves relevant content from uploaded documents
* Generates context-based answers using Gemini
* Provides source information with answers
* Uses FastAPI and PostgreSQL

## Tech Stack

* Python
* FastAPI
* PostgreSQL
* SQLAlchemy
* Gemini API
* RAG

## Project Structure

```text
app/
├── api/
├── core/
├── models/
├── schemas/
├── services/
└── main.py

requirements.txt
.env.example
README.md
```

## Run Locally

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```

The API will run at:

```text
http://127.0.0.1:8000
```
